{
  "Verify this logo's credentials": "验证此徽标的凭据",
  "Trust": "信任",
  "Where content comes from, how to check it and what happens to your data.": "内容从何而来、如何核实，以及你的数据会怎样。",
  "Our AI Stance": "我们的 AI 立场",
  "AI as labour, never as impersonation - and the machinery that enforces it.": "AI 是劳动力，绝不冒充人 - 以及保障这一点的机制。",
  "Why this differs": "为何与众不同",
  "The frictions you have been trained to accept, and what replaces them.": "你被迫习惯的那些阻碍，以及取代它们的方案。",
  "Security": "安全",
  "The cryptography, the threat model and the limits stated as plainly as the guarantees.": "密码学、威胁模型，以及与保证同样直白说明的局限。",
  "Inclusive Design": "包容性设计",
  "Accessibility, language coverage and the commitments we hold ourselves to.": "无障碍、语言覆盖，以及我们对自己的承诺。",
  "Read the detail": "阅读详情",
  "Every format in detail": "每种格式的详解",
  "Open this one": "打开这个",
  "Make something, right now": "现在就做点东西",
  "Three ordinary jobs. Pick one: it opens already filled in, and the words are yours to change.": "三件日常任务。挑一个：打开时已经填好，文字随你改。",
  "**The internet is optional here: use it when it helps, never surrender control.** A font you pick, a place you look up, a link you share - things happen online only because you asked. Nothing you make ever leaves your device, and no one is listening in. Turn the Wi-Fi off and everything still works. **Freedom is sweet.**": "**这里上网是可选项：需要时才用，绝不交出控制权。** 你选的字体、你查的地点、你分享的链接，只有你开口，联网才会发生。你做的东西从不离开你的设备，也没有人在旁窃听。关掉 Wi-Fi，一切照常运作。**自由真好。**",
  "The privacy policy": "隐私政策",
  "Verify it yourself": "自己来验证",
  "You are in control": "由你掌控",
  "AI helps only when you ask, and only with the piece you point it at. Nothing is decided for you.": "只有你开口，AI 才会帮忙，而且只处理你指定的那一部分。没有任何事替你决定。",
  "It stops costing": "不再花钱",
  "If AI helps make something once, the result is yours. Using it again is free, however many times you need it.": "AI 帮你做出来一次，成果就归你。之后再用多少次都免费。",
  "It stays honest": "始终诚实",
  "A piece made by AI says so, and what you make carries your name instead of pretending to be someone else. Even the built-in help works this way: ask it a question and it answers with the manual’s own sentence and a link, never a made-up answer.": "AI 做的作品会写明是 AI 做的，你做的作品署你的名，而不是冒充他人。内置帮助也一样：你提问，它用手册原句加一个链接回答，绝不编造。",
  "AI, on your terms": "AI，按你的规矩",
  "You never need AI here. If you want it, three things are worth knowing.": "在这里你从不需要 AI。若想用，有三点值得知道。",
  "Where we stand on AI": "我们对 AI 的立场",
  "You did not expect an infrastructure company here. The most critical problem in everyday creative tools is where the files go, and that is the problem SUSE has worked on for more than three decades, securing IT for many of the largest enterprises in the world. We had the creative problem ourselves, so we fixed it the way we fix everything: in the open, where anyone can check the work.": "你大概没想到会在这里遇到一家基础设施公司。日常创意工具最要命的问题是文件去了哪里，而 SUSE 三十多年来做的正是这件事，为全球许多最大的企业保障 IT 安全。我们自己也有创意上的难题，于是用我们解决一切问题的方式把它解决了：公开进行，任何人都能核查。",
  "Who is behind this": "这背后是谁",
  "About": "关于",
  "Free, and it stays free": "免费，而且一直免费",
  "A version that has been released is licensed so it can never be taken back. The free Lolly always exists, whatever happens next.": "已发布版本的许可让它永远无法被收回。无论以后发生什么，免费的 Lolly 都会一直存在。",
  "Open source": "开源",
  "Read it, run it, fork it, keep it. Nothing on this page needs to be believed: the code is public and the claims are checkable.": "读它、跑它、分叉它、留着它。本页的话不需要你相信：代码是公开的，说法都可核查。",
  "Blind by design": "设计上就看不见你",
  "Lolly reports nothing back. Nobody, the makers included, can see who runs it or what they make. A tool that cannot see you has nothing to sell about you.": "Lolly 不回传任何东西。包括作者在内，没有人能看到谁在用它、做了什么。看不见你的工具，也就没有关于你的东西可卖。",
  "Your vote, visible": "你的选择，看得见",
  "Your work never goes where you have no say. Anything that touches the internet happens because you chose it, at the moment you chose it, and the code that keeps that promise is open for anyone to read.": "你的作品绝不会去到你说不上话的地方。任何联网行为都因你选择而发生，就在你选择的那一刻，而兑现这一承诺的代码人人可读。",
  "Nothing to sell you, nothing to take": "没什么要卖给你，也没什么可拿走",
  "Anyone with something to make": "任何想做点东西的人",
  "The everyday jobs, finished properly.": "日常的活儿，做得像样。",
  "A poster for the fete, a price list for the stall, an invitation with a code that just works. You type the words; the layout, colours and type are already right.": "集市的海报、摊位的价目表、带一个真能扫的码的邀请函。你只管打字；版式、配色和字体已经是对的。",
  "**No account, no set-up.** Open it and start; the first file takes about a minute.": "**无需账号，无需设置。** 打开就能开始；第一个文件大约一分钟。",
  "**It comes out right.** The design decisions are already made, so you cannot pick the wrong font.": "**做出来就是对的。** 设计上的决定已经定好，你不可能选错字体。",
  "**The old way was waiting for a favour or fighting a template site.** Here it is type, look, done.": "**过去要么求人帮忙，要么跟模板网站较劲。** 在这里是打字、看一眼、完成。",
  "**Make three now.** [Make something in 60 seconds](/info/make-something.html) walks you through.": "**现在就做三个。**[60 秒做点东西](/info/make-something.html) 带你走一遍。",
  "Also built for machines": "也为机器而建",
  "An agent fills in the same tools a person does, and the people who answer for them get the security case at technical depth.": "智能体填的是和人一样的工具，而为其负责的人能拿到技术深度的安全说明。",
  "Lolly is young: its cryptography and file parsing are in SUSE’s infrastructure hardening now, the discipline behind more than three decades of securing the world’s largest enterprises. Content Credentials and local encryption are strong by design, and the security has not yet been externally audited.": "Lolly 还年轻：它的密码学与文件解析已纳入 SUSE 的基础设施加固，正是这套功夫支撑了三十多年为全球最大企业提供的安全保障。Content Credentials 与本地加密在设计上足够强，而安全性尚未经过外部审计。",
